WEBVTT

01:40.820 --> 01:44.289
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.190 --> 01:47.280
[Episode 2]

01:47.950 --> 01:48.950
Just you wait.

01:49.550 --> 01:52.020
This is just the beginning.

01:59.390 --> 02:00.310
Yuanzhong,

02:01.340 --> 02:03.950
we'll be back!

02:06.560 --> 02:07.710
Could this be the War Demons'

02:07.750 --> 02:08.690
possessing technique?

02:09.270 --> 02:11.030
Go to Tianqu Peak and find Elder Dingxu now!

02:11.030 --> 02:11.670
-Got it. -Got it.

03:19.140 --> 03:19.950
Yuanzhong,

03:21.070 --> 03:22.270
my name is Ji Tanyin,

03:22.990 --> 03:24.670
the God of Craft in the Divine Realm.

03:24.750 --> 03:26.110
Your Divine Left Hand

03:26.150 --> 03:27.470
was forged by me.

03:27.910 --> 03:30.070
Deity Taihe fell into a long slumber

03:30.070 --> 03:31.310
due to the loss of his Divine Hand.

03:31.510 --> 03:33.630
Yet you use the power of the Divine Hand

03:33.630 --> 03:34.710
to harm living beings.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.790
You don't deserve to be the host of the Divine Hand.

03:38.150 --> 03:38.950
Today,

03:39.190 --> 03:41.110
I shall reclaim the Divine Left Hand.

03:51.270 --> 03:52.660
You will die for this.

03:53.510 --> 03:54.790
But don't hold a grudge.

03:56.060 --> 03:57.190
This is the so-called karma.

03:57.510 --> 03:58.590
What goes around comes around.

03:58.990 --> 04:00.310
You deserve it.

04:01.470 --> 04:02.860
Let's begin.

04:28.950 --> 04:31.030
[Hall of Elders]

04:33.370 --> 04:35.409
[Dingxu, Grand Elder of the Youhu Clan]

04:37.130 --> 04:38.520
[Xinyao, Elder of the Youhu Clan]

04:39.960 --> 04:41.310
[Lv Chengshi, Elder of the Youhu Clan]

04:45.490 --> 04:47.540
[Lord Wenying, Elder of the Youhu Clan]

04:52.190 --> 04:53.190
Long time no see.

04:53.680 --> 04:54.630
Good morning, guys.

04:55.150 --> 04:56.110
Morning? More like late!

04:57.110 --> 04:58.750
The meeting was scheduled for around 8 AM.

04:58.870 --> 05:00.260
But it's already 2 PM now.

05:01.230 --> 05:02.040
I even deliberately

05:02.040 --> 05:03.430
set off two hours late,

05:03.430 --> 05:04.590
but when I got here,

05:04.630 --> 05:06.390
I was surprisingly the first to arrive!

05:07.070 --> 05:08.430
Lord Wenying, you're always punctual.

05:08.430 --> 05:09.590
I really respect that.

05:08.650 --> 05:11.190
[Baili Xiang, Elder of the Youhu Clan]

05:11.870 --> 05:12.750
Oh, Senior Cheng

05:12.750 --> 05:14.360
is sleeping soundly.

05:17.960 --> 05:19.330
Have you had enough sleep?

05:22.350 --> 05:23.140
Dingxu,

05:23.430 --> 05:24.750
it's already so late!

05:25.000 --> 05:27.490
The no-shows are probably not coming.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.190
If you have something to say, just say it.

05:29.310 --> 05:30.430
Yeah, Grand Elder.

05:30.630 --> 05:32.670
The Elder Council hasn't convened for years.

05:32.750 --> 05:33.870
I was surprised to receive

05:33.870 --> 05:34.950
the news last night.

05:34.950 --> 05:36.740
What exactly could be so important

05:36.740 --> 05:38.350
to gather all of us here?

05:39.120 --> 05:39.909
Grand Elder,

05:40.070 --> 05:41.670
please just tell us.

05:42.150 --> 05:44.510
You usually live far apart.

05:45.260 --> 05:47.040
It's inconvenient for you to travel here.

05:47.870 --> 05:48.990
Were it not for an urgent issue,

05:49.390 --> 05:50.750
I wouldn't have bothered you.

05:52.710 --> 05:54.180
However, today's case

05:54.870 --> 05:56.510
is indeed pretty weird.

05:56.700 --> 05:58.070
What exactly is it?

05:59.710 --> 06:00.950
Go get Tanghua here.

06:01.060 --> 06:01.850
Yes.

06:25.250 --> 06:27.370
[Divine Realm]

06:35.070 --> 06:37.150
Tanyin, why are you back?

06:37.470 --> 06:38.590
Something's confusing me.

06:38.590 --> 06:39.990
So I'd like to ask Hannv about it.

06:40.060 --> 06:41.820
Your body is still in the mortal realm,

06:41.820 --> 06:42.630
yet your soul is here.

06:42.630 --> 06:44.040
That's not safe, I'm afraid.

06:44.040 --> 06:44.950
Don't worry.

06:46.240 --> 06:47.310
Is she inside?

06:48.230 --> 06:50.180
Hannv has been in the Luofu Sea all along.

06:50.390 --> 06:51.940
That place is the realm of Supreme Yin.

06:51.940 --> 06:52.909
Guarding there for too long

06:52.909 --> 06:54.110
is not good for her health.

06:54.110 --> 06:56.310
Please go and try to persuade her.

07:02.260 --> 07:05.070
[Luofu Sea]

07:12.710 --> 07:15.100
[Hannv, Goddess of Embroidery, Immortal Race]

07:19.890 --> 07:21.730
[Taihe, Primordial God, Immortal Race]

07:28.950 --> 07:29.950
Hannv.

07:31.510 --> 07:32.310
Tanyin!

07:32.470 --> 07:33.390
Welcome back.

07:34.120 --> 07:34.920
How is it?

07:36.230 --> 07:37.110
Not good.

07:38.260 --> 07:40.340
Taihe's taking a turn for the worse.

07:40.760 --> 07:41.600
His primordial power

07:41.630 --> 07:42.990
is gradually dissipating.

07:43.470 --> 07:44.670
The Supreme Yin power of the Luofu Sea

07:44.670 --> 07:46.110
can't sustain him for much longer.

07:47.270 --> 07:48.870
What brings you back all of a sudden?

07:49.630 --> 07:51.230
Is that High Priest of the Youhu Clan

07:51.230 --> 07:52.270
a hard nut to crack?

07:53.550 --> 07:55.790
There's something I can't figure out.

07:56.270 --> 07:57.070
What is it?

07:57.780 --> 07:58.790
I wanna ask you

07:59.060 --> 08:00.430
if the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

08:00.510 --> 08:02.600
is really a brutal man.

08:03.110 --> 08:04.470
Why would you ask this?

08:05.630 --> 08:06.790
I saw him.

08:07.150 --> 08:08.150
And he seems different

08:08.150 --> 08:09.150
from what everyone says.

08:09.510 --> 08:10.310
Besides,

08:10.390 --> 08:11.990
he's always wearing a golden hoop.

08:11.990 --> 08:13.390
That's a sealing artifact.

08:13.590 --> 08:14.600
I don't understand.

08:14.910 --> 08:16.830
Isn't he the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

08:16.990 --> 08:18.590
and the ruler of the mortal realm?

08:19.110 --> 08:20.740
Why is he wearing a shackle?

08:22.630 --> 08:24.230
Why do you care about this?

08:24.250 --> 08:25.450
Of course I care.

08:25.990 --> 08:27.550
If my guess is right,

08:28.510 --> 08:29.750
then what we know

08:29.750 --> 08:31.110
might all be false.

08:31.550 --> 08:32.900
Maybe he's a weak man,

08:33.030 --> 08:35.669
or maybe he's a good guy.

08:36.140 --> 08:37.830
Is a weak person necessarily good?

08:38.270 --> 08:40.789
Does wearing shackles prevent one from doing evil?

08:43.070 --> 08:44.430
Perhaps just because

08:44.510 --> 08:46.270
he committed too many evil deeds,

08:46.950 --> 08:48.390
he was put under a seal

08:48.830 --> 08:50.550
and bound with a restraining artifact.

08:51.790 --> 08:53.590
You have a point, but...

08:53.590 --> 08:54.550
But what?

08:55.070 --> 08:56.430
Even if he is a good person,

08:56.500 --> 08:57.550
so what?

08:57.990 --> 08:59.660
The Divine Left Hand doesn't belong to him.

08:59.870 --> 09:01.750
His taking possession of the divine artifact is a sin.

09:02.350 --> 09:04.590
Deity Taihe is the Primordial God,

09:04.790 --> 09:05.870
the law of heaven

09:05.870 --> 09:07.470
chosen by the primordial power.

09:07.500 --> 09:09.230
He's the guardian of all realms,

09:09.250 --> 09:11.330
yet fell into a long slumber due to demon slaying.

09:11.870 --> 09:12.670
Therefore,

09:12.910 --> 09:14.590
whether that High Priest of the Youhu Clan

09:14.810 --> 09:16.520
is good or evil,

09:16.790 --> 09:18.110
righteous or wicked,

09:18.670 --> 09:20.190
you have only one choice.

09:20.870 --> 09:21.670
Tanyin,

09:22.390 --> 09:23.710
Taihe has waited for too long.

09:23.990 --> 09:25.190
Please help us.

09:31.510 --> 09:33.140
That's not the way it works, Hannv.

09:33.550 --> 09:34.950
The gods protect all living beings

09:35.140 --> 09:36.290
with compassion for them.

09:36.550 --> 09:37.670
Deliver them from torment.

09:37.870 --> 09:39.110
All beings are equal.

09:39.150 --> 09:40.350
All things are equal.

09:41.270 --> 09:42.910
But maybe you're right.

09:43.510 --> 09:46.140
The weak are not necessarily good.

09:46.510 --> 09:47.470
Even those in shackles

09:47.470 --> 09:48.870
may not be incapable of evil.

09:49.390 --> 09:50.910
So I will get to the bottom of it.

10:23.080 --> 10:24.070
What are you doing?

10:25.110 --> 10:26.230
Just taking a break.

10:26.910 --> 10:27.960
Early spring is the time

10:28.110 --> 10:29.260
when animals in the mountains like snakes

10:29.260 --> 10:30.270
are awakening.

10:31.270 --> 10:32.360
You need to be careful.

10:43.110 --> 10:43.990
What's wrong?

10:45.910 --> 10:48.920
I've been poisoned, I guess.

10:54.230 --> 10:55.030
It's alright.

10:55.870 --> 10:56.830
I'm an immortal.

10:57.230 --> 10:58.670
A snake bite won't kill me.

11:00.230 --> 11:01.430
I'm here for you.

11:04.350 --> 11:05.630
Greetings, Elders.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.670
Tanghua,

11:07.300 --> 11:08.950
it was your subordinate who got killed.

11:09.150 --> 11:10.700
You've been investigating all night.

11:11.070 --> 11:12.310
Did you find out anything?

11:12.740 --> 11:14.660
Before Chiyi died, his eyes were blood-red,

11:14.790 --> 11:15.790
his strength was immense,

11:16.590 --> 11:18.630
and it seemed as if blood snakes were crawling under his skin

11:18.750 --> 11:20.440
with faint incantations appearing on it.

11:20.630 --> 11:21.710
More importantly,

11:21.740 --> 11:22.980
he completely lost his mind,

11:24.030 --> 11:25.870
like he had become a whole different person.

11:26.630 --> 11:27.630
All of these signs

11:28.230 --> 11:29.910
remind me of a possibility.

11:30.350 --> 11:31.310
I suspect

11:33.070 --> 11:34.710
he was affected by the possessing technique.

11:34.750 --> 11:35.550
What?

11:36.630 --> 11:38.070
Nonsense.

11:38.600 --> 11:40.360
The possessing technique is a secret skill

11:40.360 --> 11:41.550
of the War Demons,

11:41.590 --> 11:43.470
Yet the War Demons have long since died out.

11:43.950 --> 11:45.910
How could anyone fall victim to it nowadays?

11:46.430 --> 11:48.590
I remember back then

11:48.590 --> 11:50.480
we studied the possessing technique.

11:50.710 --> 11:51.870
The possession

11:51.870 --> 11:53.790
always happened on the target's birthday.

11:54.830 --> 11:56.590
At that time, we analyzed

11:56.830 --> 11:58.710
that this kind of unnatural evil technique

11:58.990 --> 12:00.630
must have some limitations.

12:01.150 --> 12:03.030
Blood and birth information

12:03.310 --> 12:04.110
could all be

12:04.110 --> 12:05.540
significant factors.

12:05.910 --> 12:07.910
If it's true as you say

12:08.310 --> 12:10.230
that Chiyi was hit by the possessing technique,

12:10.310 --> 12:11.230
then yesterday

12:11.230 --> 12:12.990
should be Chiyi's birthday.

12:13.270 --> 12:14.870
Elder Xinyao's words make sense.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.430
I've thought about this too.

12:17.380 --> 12:19.470
But since the emergence of the evil possessing technique,

12:19.670 --> 12:20.430
our people

12:20.430 --> 12:22.230
have no longer celebrated birthdays.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.190
One's birth information

12:23.190 --> 12:24.950
has become everyone's personal secret.

12:26.790 --> 12:28.070
Chiyi has no family.

12:28.830 --> 12:29.510
Neither do I know

12:29.510 --> 12:30.790
his exact date and time of birth.

12:32.100 --> 12:34.300
The incident happened in the Liujiao Palace.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.870
What did the High Priest say about it?

12:37.390 --> 12:39.230
The High Priest was frightened last night

12:39.540 --> 12:40.670
and rested early.

12:41.150 --> 12:42.750
He didn't say much to me.

12:43.830 --> 12:44.750
Frightened?

12:44.870 --> 12:46.660
The High Priest is someone

12:46.660 --> 12:49.150
who could even break through Pinghu Xianzhou with one blow.

12:49.640 --> 12:50.830
Could this small case

12:51.030 --> 12:52.390
possibly frighten him?

12:52.990 --> 12:54.110
In this world,

12:54.780 --> 12:55.950
no one

12:55.950 --> 12:57.550
knows the War Demons better than him.

12:58.670 --> 13:00.470
Then let's invite the High Priest here.

13:01.470 --> 13:02.270
Yes.

13:03.740 --> 13:04.590
What is this?

13:04.950 --> 13:06.270
It knocked me out yesterday.

13:07.260 --> 13:08.830
I-It didn't knock you out.

13:09.310 --> 13:10.070
It's because

13:10.070 --> 13:11.590
it contains a strong alcoholic scent.

13:11.590 --> 13:13.070
So it makes people intoxicated.

13:13.430 --> 13:14.270
A good sleep

13:14.270 --> 13:15.740
is the first step to welcoming good fortune.

13:21.630 --> 13:22.780
Aren't you maids

13:22.830 --> 13:24.390
supposed to be training at Xiaoxiang Peak?

13:24.670 --> 13:25.790
How did you end up here?

13:27.270 --> 13:28.710
There was a big dog over there,

13:28.710 --> 13:29.710
chasing after people.

13:29.840 --> 13:32.020
I got scared and took a wrong turn.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.390
There are no dogs on Fangwai Mountain.

13:33.470 --> 13:34.190
How could there be

13:34.190 --> 13:35.470
no dogs on such a huge mountain？

13:35.540 --> 13:36.590
Perhaps it ran here from somewhere else.

13:36.590 --> 13:37.790
You just don't know that.

13:47.100 --> 13:48.500
Let me apply some medicine for you.

14:07.630 --> 14:08.590
Where is it?

14:09.350 --> 14:10.740
I remember I've got some.

14:14.070 --> 14:14.910
Found it.

14:15.190 --> 14:16.960
That's it. This medicine is super effective.

14:27.230 --> 14:28.110
What's that?

14:29.990 --> 14:31.030
It's a portable cosmic bag.

14:31.430 --> 14:32.230
A portable cosmic bag?

14:33.440 --> 14:34.510
Isn't that the personal artifact

14:34.510 --> 14:36.350
of Goddess Wushuang, the God of Craft?

14:36.710 --> 14:38.420
They say the crafting method has long been lost.

14:38.450 --> 14:39.450
How do you have one?

14:40.270 --> 14:41.070
Lost?

14:45.720 --> 14:47.210
Actually, it's quite simple.

14:47.470 --> 14:49.060
This is just an ordinary artifact.

14:49.060 --> 14:50.550
Don't you immortals also have

14:50.550 --> 14:52.070
spells for telekinesis?

14:52.230 --> 14:53.550
It's the same principle.

14:54.140 --> 14:55.050
-But...
-Yuanzhong!

14:56.990 --> 14:57.790
Yuanzhong.

14:59.710 --> 15:00.990
The Council of Elders sent a messenger here,

15:00.990 --> 15:01.990
asking you to go over.

15:07.350 --> 15:08.230
What's wrong?

15:08.830 --> 15:09.620
Nothing.

15:09.650 --> 15:10.890
I just got bitten by a snake.

15:14.590 --> 15:15.630
You're Ji Tanyin, right?

15:18.340 --> 15:19.350
How do you know that?

15:19.590 --> 15:20.620
Of course I know.

15:23.110 --> 15:24.310
Don't you know who I am?

15:25.510 --> 15:26.430
No, I don't.

15:28.240 --> 15:29.120
Then you're stupid.

15:36.140 --> 15:36.950
Grand Elder,

15:38.590 --> 15:39.620
the High Priest said

15:39.620 --> 15:41.350
he hasn't finished his studies for today,

15:41.350 --> 15:42.350
so he can't come.

15:42.360 --> 15:44.250
He asked me to pass on a message to you.

15:44.590 --> 15:45.380
He said

15:45.910 --> 15:48.230
all the War Demons were wiped out in Pinghu

15:48.260 --> 15:49.580
with no survivors.

15:50.110 --> 15:51.510
Anyone who doubts this

15:51.510 --> 15:52.550
for any reason

15:52.550 --> 15:54.030
must be up to something

15:54.270 --> 15:55.550
and should be thoroughly investigated.

16:00.630 --> 16:01.950
Go investigate Ji Tanyin.

16:02.350 --> 16:03.510
Like her birth details,

16:03.590 --> 16:04.630
background,

16:04.710 --> 16:05.790
life experiences,

16:05.830 --> 16:06.790
hobbies, and interests.

16:06.870 --> 16:07.670
I wanna know everything.

16:07.670 --> 16:09.550
Why? Does she work for Dingxu?

16:09.630 --> 16:10.430
Doesn't seem like it.

16:11.150 --> 16:13.470
Then is she a spy sent by the human race?

16:15.070 --> 16:16.350
Not sure yet.

16:16.710 --> 16:17.430
She couldn't be

16:17.430 --> 16:18.830
sent by the War Demons, right?

16:20.510 --> 16:22.190
The Elders' meeting should be over.

16:22.710 --> 16:24.430
Tanghua must be furious.

16:24.870 --> 16:25.870
No way...

16:25.900 --> 16:28.020
He's a petty simpleton.

16:29.230 --> 16:30.030
That's true.

16:39.710 --> 16:40.790
Tanyin, you're back.

16:41.660 --> 16:43.250
We need to go to the Teaching Hall after dinner.

16:43.390 --> 16:44.550
Tomorrow is the day for the immortal elders

16:44.550 --> 16:45.750
of each peak to select their maids.

16:45.750 --> 16:46.830
We need to draw lots in advance

16:46.830 --> 16:47.990
to determine the order.

16:48.070 --> 16:49.110
Select maids?

16:49.390 --> 16:50.190
Tomorrow?

17:00.340 --> 17:01.740
I know I'm asking for too much.

17:02.620 --> 17:03.960
This is my own affair.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.310
I should handle it myself.

17:07.109 --> 17:08.230
God,

17:08.770 --> 17:09.880
please bless me.

17:14.730 --> 17:16.599
[Youhu Clan's Xiaoxiang Peak]

17:17.260 --> 17:18.349
Remember the rules

17:18.349 --> 17:19.550
of the grand selection.

17:19.990 --> 17:20.780
You will go in

17:20.780 --> 17:22.099
and wait for instructions.

17:22.710 --> 17:23.750
Whether you stay or leave

17:23.940 --> 17:25.430
depends on your fate.

17:26.060 --> 17:27.910
Madam, aren't coming in with us?

17:29.580 --> 17:31.660
It's about time. You may go in.

17:32.470 --> 17:33.270
-Yes, Madam. -Yes, Madam.

18:31.390 --> 18:32.590
Well, Lord Wenying,

18:33.110 --> 18:34.190
how weird.

18:34.470 --> 18:35.510
You don't indulge in women,

18:35.510 --> 18:36.720
nor do you accept female disciples.

18:36.720 --> 18:38.020
Why are you here today

18:38.020 --> 18:39.110
to select maids?

18:40.350 --> 18:41.950
The old cook has aged,

18:42.310 --> 18:44.550
and the new one is clumsy,

18:44.570 --> 18:46.160
making food like swill.

18:48.110 --> 18:49.510
It is a top priority.

18:51.270 --> 18:52.950
I heard that these human maids

18:52.950 --> 18:54.990
are proficient in music, chess, calligraphy, and painting.

18:55.050 --> 18:56.980
Not to mention their top-class needlework and cooking.

18:57.220 --> 18:59.690
Hope you choose a good one for yourself.

19:07.640 --> 19:09.510
Baili, Lord Wenying,

19:09.950 --> 19:10.870
Elder Xinyao.

19:12.070 --> 19:13.750
Tanghua, you are now

19:13.750 --> 19:15.150
one of the Elders.

19:15.310 --> 19:16.570
No need to be so formal.

19:17.470 --> 19:19.350
Have you finished arranging Chiyi's funeral?

19:20.550 --> 19:22.150
You seem to have quite some free time.

19:26.270 --> 19:27.910
Tanghua, take a seat.

19:27.930 --> 19:29.060
It's about to begin.

19:31.140 --> 19:32.540
The High Priest has arrived!

19:37.870 --> 19:39.270
No wonder you're here.

19:44.340 --> 19:45.310
-High Priest. -High Priest.

19:50.300 --> 19:51.300
What a rare sight.

19:51.350 --> 19:52.590
Even you have joined us today.

19:52.710 --> 19:54.150
Seems like these maid candidates

19:54.150 --> 19:55.310
are quite fortunate.

19:55.400 --> 19:57.070
You're late, High Priest.

19:57.390 --> 19:59.910
I suppose you must have been held up

19:59.950 --> 20:01.230
by some fair maid.

20:02.510 --> 20:03.300
Indeed.

20:03.740 --> 20:05.030
These human women

20:05.050 --> 20:06.340
mostly don't cultivate the Dao.

20:06.640 --> 20:07.660
They just pursue beauty.

20:08.710 --> 20:10.150
Lord Wenying, you're getting on in years

20:10.270 --> 20:11.390
with a dignified appearance.

20:11.500 --> 20:13.700
You surely don't know my troubles.

20:27.470 --> 20:28.350
High Priest,

20:30.150 --> 20:31.570
Elder Dingxu is swamped with work.

20:31.710 --> 20:32.830
So he's asked me to preside over this year's

20:32.830 --> 20:33.870
maid selection ceremony.

20:33.910 --> 20:35.100
Therefore, today's main examination

20:35.100 --> 20:36.470
will follow the old rules.

20:36.470 --> 20:39.670
We will test the four arts—music, chess, calligraphy, and painting.

20:44.310 --> 20:46.470
You wanna be a maid in the Liujiao Palace?

20:47.470 --> 20:48.550
Can you really pass

20:48.550 --> 20:49.710
the maid assessment?

20:50.980 --> 20:53.180
Though calligraphy and painting are not my forte,

20:53.470 --> 20:55.550
I think I should be able to pass.

20:55.970 --> 20:57.490
I know little about music.

20:57.830 --> 20:59.350
But I can cheat a little.

21:00.310 --> 21:02.060
I only don't know what to do with chess.

21:03.240 --> 21:05.790
You've come to the right person.

21:05.840 --> 21:08.080
In all six realms, when it comes to chess,

21:08.510 --> 21:09.750
if I rank second,

21:09.750 --> 21:11.740
no one dares to claim they're first.

21:12.150 --> 21:13.150
Then

21:13.220 --> 21:15.180
I'll be counting on you, Mr. Loong.

21:20.870 --> 21:21.880
This round of assessment

21:21.880 --> 21:23.200
will test your chess skills.

21:23.220 --> 21:24.140
You'll play against each other in pairs.

21:24.430 --> 21:26.030
The losers will be eliminated.

21:26.590 --> 21:27.430
Let's begin.

21:41.470 --> 21:43.180
Please give me a minute to think.

21:49.330 --> 21:50.510
The same old opening moves

21:50.680 --> 21:52.040
in chess.

21:52.200 --> 21:53.110
A thousand years have passed,

21:53.110 --> 21:54.270
yet the human chess players

21:54.270 --> 21:55.710
haven't improved much.

22:03.470 --> 22:04.590
Just for this one move,

22:04.590 --> 22:06.070
is it necessary to think for so long?

22:16.750 --> 22:17.460
You...

22:29.180 --> 22:31.180
What a brilliant move!

22:32.310 --> 22:33.790
With such amazing chess skills,

22:34.750 --> 22:36.190
she could have

22:36.190 --> 22:37.340
ended this game quickly.

22:37.800 --> 22:39.510
Why is she putting on a show

22:39.710 --> 22:40.630
and dragging it out like this?

22:41.070 --> 22:42.030
Perhaps she wants to attract

22:42.030 --> 22:43.230
our attention.

22:43.250 --> 22:44.970
Although we're the ones selecting,

22:45.080 --> 22:47.320
they also have their preferences

22:47.350 --> 22:49.150
for which immortal elder to serve and follow.

22:52.150 --> 22:53.110
I lost.

23:00.070 --> 23:00.950
Good game.

23:03.000 --> 23:03.790
High Priest,

23:04.130 --> 23:05.130
do you know her?

23:06.140 --> 23:07.140
I've met her a few times.

23:09.650 --> 23:11.290
No wonder you graced us with your presence.

23:11.710 --> 23:12.680
Turns out you've got

23:13.510 --> 23:15.050
someone in mind.

23:20.940 --> 23:22.180
The first round is over.

23:22.200 --> 23:23.670
Winners, go prepare

23:24.060 --> 23:24.980
for the next test,

23:25.150 --> 23:26.000
music skills.

23:35.950 --> 23:37.070
That is a smooth

23:37.350 --> 23:38.510
and lingering melody.

23:38.990 --> 23:39.910
Excellent.

23:43.350 --> 23:44.230
Next.

23:44.430 --> 23:45.470
Ji Tanyin.

23:50.030 --> 23:51.200
We've prepared an instrument here.

23:51.350 --> 23:52.910
I'm used to playing my own instrument.

23:53.190 --> 23:53.990
Sheng Xiang,

23:54.630 --> 23:55.670
all music masters

23:55.670 --> 23:57.040
prefer to use their own instruments.

23:57.090 --> 23:58.030
Let her use it.

24:10.430 --> 24:11.830
I need to tune it.

25:00.470 --> 25:02.110
Those of you who have made it this far

25:02.110 --> 25:03.430
are all exceptionally skilled

25:03.450 --> 25:04.460
and outstanding candidates.

25:04.630 --> 25:06.190
I want to congratulate you in advance

25:06.360 --> 25:07.590
on your stay.

25:09.150 --> 25:10.580
Thank you, Immortal Elder.

25:12.110 --> 25:13.390
For this final round,

25:13.590 --> 25:14.580
you can choose

25:14.580 --> 25:16.500
to showcase your best talents.

25:16.630 --> 25:19.350
If you're fortunate enough to be picked by an immortal elder,

25:19.440 --> 25:22.370
you'll have the chance to cultivate under their guidance.

25:22.590 --> 25:24.670
This is a great opportunity.

25:24.980 --> 25:27.450
Cherish it well.

25:27.970 --> 25:28.770
-Yes, sir. -Yes, sir.

25:43.830 --> 25:45.920
[Forbidden Land] [Into the land, into the doom.]

25:46.650 --> 25:48.090
There's an intruder! Stay alert!

25:52.920 --> 25:54.440
What's your talent?

25:55.590 --> 25:56.860
I am a craftsman.

25:57.630 --> 25:58.470
Craftsman?

25:59.130 --> 26:00.860
What does a craftsman do?

26:01.550 --> 26:02.920
A concept from the human realm.

26:02.950 --> 26:03.910
Just an artisan.

26:04.510 --> 26:06.230
They're good at making things like carriages,

26:06.230 --> 26:07.030
tables, chairs,

26:07.050 --> 26:08.490
household items, and decorations.

26:08.940 --> 26:10.460
What kind of talent is that?

26:11.030 --> 26:13.340
Don't tell me you're going to

26:13.340 --> 26:14.680
build a carriage right here, huh?

26:15.070 --> 26:16.110
I can, actually.

26:16.190 --> 26:17.350
But the space here

26:17.350 --> 26:18.390
doesn't seem big enough.

26:18.430 --> 26:19.430
Besides, building a carriage

26:19.430 --> 26:20.950
doesn't require much skill.

26:22.160 --> 26:23.550
So what are you going to demonstrate?

26:24.990 --> 26:26.170
I can unlock this.

26:28.670 --> 26:29.470
Lord Wenying,

26:29.870 --> 26:31.230
if I remember correctly,

26:31.300 --> 26:33.030
it was you who made this batch

26:33.030 --> 26:34.430
of Two-Form Immobilizing Bracelets.

26:34.510 --> 26:35.310
That's true.

26:35.630 --> 26:37.240
I made them.

26:37.680 --> 26:38.470
Young lady,

26:38.740 --> 26:40.500
are you serious?

26:40.870 --> 26:42.190
The Two-Form Immobilizing Bracelet

26:42.190 --> 26:44.020
is made of immortal gold,

26:44.550 --> 26:46.430
containing a binding formation.

26:46.710 --> 26:48.350
They are divine artifacts of our clan.

26:48.550 --> 26:50.510
How could a mere craftsman like you

26:50.510 --> 26:52.390
unlock them so easily?

26:52.830 --> 26:53.630
Are you...

27:02.710 --> 27:04.230
How did you do that?

27:04.590 --> 27:06.670
Everything in nature has strengths and weaknesses.

27:06.790 --> 27:07.790
There's no such thing

27:07.790 --> 27:09.270
as an indestructible object.

27:09.590 --> 27:11.110
Although immortal gold is tough,

27:11.240 --> 27:12.670
it also has vulnerabilities.

27:13.000 --> 27:15.030
Moreover, human craftsmanship

27:15.150 --> 27:16.830
isn't limited to making

27:16.830 --> 27:18.350
household items and decorations only.

27:18.870 --> 27:20.270
What do you think, High Priest?

27:22.990 --> 27:24.110
What are you trying to say?

27:25.100 --> 27:26.370
This Two-Form Immobilizing Bracelet

27:26.390 --> 27:27.960
is just a minor artifact

27:28.070 --> 27:29.030
with simple craftsmanship.

27:29.030 --> 27:31.070
Why not let me try something else?

27:32.060 --> 27:33.350
What else do you want to unlock?

27:33.950 --> 27:35.790
The shackle around your neck, High Priest.

27:35.820 --> 27:37.260
I'd like to give it a try.

27:43.590 --> 27:44.710
What did you just say?

27:44.980 --> 27:46.350
I said I want to try

27:46.370 --> 27:48.010
if I can open that shackle.

27:48.670 --> 27:49.470
How dare you!

27:49.870 --> 27:50.750
This golden hoop

27:50.750 --> 27:52.020
was finely forged with the combined efforts

27:52.020 --> 27:52.870
of our entire clan

27:52.870 --> 27:54.310
and specially presented to the High Priest.

27:54.430 --> 27:56.030
Don't speak nonsense!

27:56.180 --> 27:57.820
Restraint and confinement make a lock.

27:58.030 --> 27:59.590
Binding and imprisonment make shackles.

27:59.920 --> 28:01.640
It's just a tool to restrict freedom

28:01.670 --> 28:03.150
and curb power!

28:03.720 --> 28:04.910
You make it sound so nice,

28:05.150 --> 28:06.950
but why don't you wear it yourself?

28:07.070 --> 28:07.870
You...

28:08.430 --> 28:09.510
You're not wrong.

28:09.950 --> 28:11.150
This was indeed forged for me

28:11.150 --> 28:12.420
by the Elders of my clan.

28:13.350 --> 28:14.990
But you only see a shackle

28:15.270 --> 28:16.750
without seeing the deeper meaning.

28:17.110 --> 28:18.230
Haven't you heard of that?

28:18.410 --> 28:20.140
"Throwing one into a deadly place of no return

28:20.320 --> 28:22.680
will make him or her stronger."

28:23.110 --> 28:24.700
This is from your human military strategy.

28:24.870 --> 28:26.230
I find it quite reasonable.

28:26.630 --> 28:27.950
The Tao Te Ching also says,

28:28.480 --> 28:30.910
"Reduce again and again until you reach non-action.

28:31.130 --> 28:33.040
Through non-action, you can achieve everything.

28:33.550 --> 28:34.640
Those who know and outdo themselves

28:34.750 --> 28:35.750
are enlightened and strong."

28:35.910 --> 28:37.590
You see it as a shackle,

28:37.830 --> 28:38.950
but I see it

28:39.480 --> 28:41.070
as a ladder of greatness and success

28:41.070 --> 28:42.030
to climb.

28:42.580 --> 28:43.910
If it's not a shackle,

28:44.110 --> 28:46.470
do you dare to let me unlock it?

28:55.990 --> 28:56.790
Sure.

28:56.790 --> 28:57.710
High Priest!

28:58.790 --> 29:00.230
Do you really think

29:00.250 --> 29:02.010
a mere human girl

29:02.150 --> 29:03.660
can open this golden hoop?

29:03.690 --> 29:04.370
Well...

29:24.190 --> 29:24.820
Come on,

29:26.090 --> 29:26.890
give it a try.

30:02.030 --> 30:02.830
Yuanzhong!

30:09.900 --> 30:10.710
How is it?

30:11.550 --> 30:13.060
This is no ordinary craftsmanship.

30:13.940 --> 30:15.150
I can't unlock it for now.

30:16.110 --> 30:17.580
Recognizing your shortcomings

30:18.120 --> 30:19.560
is also a kind of gain.

30:21.590 --> 30:22.780
This girl is so bold

30:22.780 --> 30:23.950
that she's even hurt you, High Priest.

30:23.950 --> 30:25.550
I'll take her away for punishment.

30:25.550 --> 30:26.390
Don't bother.

30:26.730 --> 30:28.370
It's nothing but a minor injury.

30:28.870 --> 30:30.260
I like this girl.

30:30.720 --> 30:32.070
Let her join my Liujiao Palace.

30:32.510 --> 30:33.510
No way...

30:34.830 --> 30:35.830
Why not?

30:36.420 --> 30:38.120
Isn't she the one you selected?

30:41.190 --> 30:42.430
Tell me, Ji Tanyin.

30:42.830 --> 30:44.020
Would you like to join my Liujiao Palace

30:44.020 --> 30:44.920
as a maid

30:45.310 --> 30:47.470
to follow and serve me?

30:52.190 --> 30:53.070
Yes, I'd like to.

31:01.070 --> 31:02.390
Yuanzhong, you brat.

31:03.050 --> 31:04.210
Go to hell.

31:16.310 --> 31:17.110
Stop!

31:26.960 --> 31:27.960
There you are.

31:34.220 --> 31:36.060
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

31:36.060 --> 31:37.550
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

31:37.550 --> 31:39.070
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

31:39.070 --> 31:40.580
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

31:40.580 --> 31:42.070
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

31:42.070 --> 31:43.540
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

31:43.540 --> 31:45.350
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

31:47.070 --> 31:47.870
Xiazhi!

31:48.820 --> 31:50.390
Zi Fei, what did you do?

31:50.830 --> 31:51.630
He's gone mad,

31:51.630 --> 31:52.670
trying to kill the High Priest!

31:52.670 --> 31:53.710
Shouldn't I kill him?

31:54.640 --> 31:55.450
Xiazhi...

31:56.950 --> 31:57.740
Xiazhi...

31:58.390 --> 31:59.960
What did his last words mean?

32:01.010 --> 32:02.240
Did anyone understand?

32:03.930 --> 32:05.410
The end draws near;

32:06.460 --> 32:07.890
desperation haunts.

32:26.350 --> 32:27.190
High Priest.

32:27.990 --> 32:28.790
You're here.

32:30.550 --> 32:32.150
You look upset.

32:32.790 --> 32:34.870
Is it because General Xiazhi

32:34.870 --> 32:36.230
was possessed today?

32:39.930 --> 32:41.280
Do you know what possession is?

32:41.670 --> 32:42.790
I've heard about it.

32:42.890 --> 32:43.920
It's a method that the War Demons use

32:44.740 --> 32:46.350
to control others.

32:46.510 --> 32:47.910
As long as they know the person's name

32:47.910 --> 32:48.790
and date of birth,

32:48.890 --> 32:51.090
they can use sorcery to manipulate them,

32:51.390 --> 32:52.430
making them live

32:52.430 --> 32:53.670
or die at will.

32:54.100 --> 32:55.730
That's an extremely vicious mean.

32:57.750 --> 32:58.910
You seem to know quite a bit.

33:00.750 --> 33:01.780
Are there just the two of us

33:01.870 --> 33:03.470
on Yuquan Peak?

33:04.350 --> 33:05.270
Zi Fei's usually here too,

33:05.570 --> 33:06.720
but not tonight.

33:15.190 --> 33:16.190
They've got me

33:16.190 --> 33:17.230
a new one.

33:17.790 --> 33:18.870
Can you still remove it?

33:19.400 --> 33:21.550
They've changed the restriction slightly.

33:21.910 --> 33:23.230
I need to work on it a bit more.

33:25.910 --> 33:26.950
Your craftsmanship is impressive.

33:27.510 --> 33:29.760
What a pity I couldn't remove yours.

33:29.990 --> 33:30.910
Mine?

33:31.400 --> 33:32.950
Mine isn't so easy to remove.

33:34.810 --> 33:37.080
It looks a bit heavy.

33:37.410 --> 33:38.890
It's actually way heavier than it looks.

33:39.150 --> 33:40.710
Then why do you always wear it?

33:41.150 --> 33:42.150
Too many onlookers during the day.

33:42.190 --> 33:43.670
But now you can tell the truth.

33:43.670 --> 33:44.620
Because it looks good.

33:44.870 --> 33:46.340
Don't you feel uncomfortable with it?

33:47.430 --> 33:48.230
Not at all.

33:48.430 --> 33:50.390
But it has already

33:50.390 --> 33:51.390
cut your neck.

33:51.710 --> 33:52.710
For the sake of beauty,

33:52.740 --> 33:54.100
a little sacrifice

33:54.190 --> 33:55.260
is inevitable.

33:57.080 --> 33:59.040
It's getting late. You may leave now.

34:17.679 --> 34:19.760
My method is not feasible for my dad.

34:20.949 --> 34:23.179
But the Youhu Clan also has a secret way to longevity.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.710
The elixir of immortality

34:25.710 --> 34:27.150
concocted by Grand Elder Dingxu

34:27.150 --> 34:28.630
has miraculous effects on our clan.

34:28.670 --> 34:30.830
Can we

34:30.830 --> 34:32.550
ask the Youhu Clan for it directly?

34:32.830 --> 34:34.030
They won't give it to us.

34:36.790 --> 34:37.620
We need to find a way

34:37.620 --> 34:39.110
to remove this thing.

34:41.670 --> 34:42.670
There's someone

34:42.920 --> 34:44.429
who might be able to help us.

34:50.909 --> 34:53.920
The end draws near; desperation haunts.

34:54.710 --> 34:57.030
Is this the phrase you heard?

34:57.510 --> 34:58.430
I'm sure.

34:58.870 --> 35:01.630
Have the War Demons really come back?

35:01.630 --> 35:02.710
Nonsense!

35:02.870 --> 35:04.580
Everyone can say a few mottos of the War Demons!

35:04.950 --> 35:06.030
What does that prove?

35:06.150 --> 35:06.950
Exactly.

35:06.990 --> 35:07.790
In that battle at Pinghu,

35:07.790 --> 35:09.590
the War Demons all died right before us.

35:09.840 --> 35:11.280
We all witnessed it ourselves.

35:11.550 --> 35:12.580
If you don't believe others,

35:12.750 --> 35:14.190
you should at least trust your own eyes!

35:14.430 --> 35:16.450
The War Demons at Pinghu did die out.

35:16.830 --> 35:18.390
But who can guarantee

35:18.590 --> 35:20.190
that they don't have other clan members

35:20.190 --> 35:21.550
who hid elsewhere and survived?

35:21.990 --> 35:23.350
If they're still alive,

35:23.350 --> 35:25.110
why have they been silent for years?

35:25.280 --> 35:26.110
Our clan and the humans

35:26.110 --> 35:27.270
have searched everywhere

35:27.270 --> 35:28.550
yet found nothing.

35:28.550 --> 35:29.910
The world is vast.

35:30.310 --> 35:31.990
Are you sure you haven't missed anything?

35:32.980 --> 35:33.790
Tanghua,

35:34.760 --> 35:36.470
it's a man of your troops who died again.

35:36.750 --> 35:37.870
Do you have anything to say?

35:38.510 --> 35:39.390
I have no idea.

35:40.190 --> 35:41.300
It's the War Demons.

35:41.660 --> 35:42.470
That's right.

35:42.960 --> 35:44.080
It's them.

35:45.950 --> 35:46.750
Lord Wenying,

35:47.400 --> 35:48.870
what did you say? Speak up.

35:48.870 --> 35:50.020
I said it's the War Demons!

35:50.020 --> 35:51.150
It must be them!

35:51.830 --> 35:52.660
I saw the possessing technique

35:52.660 --> 35:54.270
on the battlefield with my own eyes.

35:54.270 --> 35:55.990
It's exactly the same as what happened to Xiazhi!

35:56.510 --> 35:57.830
They've returned.

35:58.310 --> 36:00.430
The War Demons have come back!

36:01.190 --> 36:02.360
Clam down, Lord Wenying.

36:02.550 --> 36:04.100
This hasn't been confirmed yet.

36:04.100 --> 36:05.990
It'll be too late if we wait for confirmation!

36:08.630 --> 36:09.590
The High Priest...

36:11.280 --> 36:12.070
Dingxu,

36:12.110 --> 36:13.340
you should remove the High Priest's...

36:13.340 --> 36:14.070
Silence!

36:21.910 --> 36:23.630
Everything's just speculation at this point.

36:23.630 --> 36:25.150
We shouldn't lose our composure, right?

36:26.240 --> 36:27.630
This matter requires further investigation.

36:28.000 --> 36:30.340
Since two men of the troops lost their minds,

36:30.590 --> 36:32.990
all soldiers shall disarm

36:32.990 --> 36:33.990
and submit to questioning.

36:34.110 --> 36:34.910
Baili Xiang,

36:37.270 --> 36:39.150
I'm entrusting this to you.

36:39.910 --> 36:40.710
Understood.

36:41.550 --> 36:43.030
No one is allowed to disturb

36:43.570 --> 36:44.990
the High Priest's cultivation

36:44.990 --> 36:46.350
until we find out the truth.

36:47.430 --> 36:48.470
Do you understand?

36:48.910 --> 36:49.710
-Yes. -Yes.

37:17.470 --> 37:19.280
Are you Elder Lv Chengshi of Quantan Mountain?

37:19.470 --> 37:20.270
Yes, it's me.

37:20.990 --> 37:22.310
I have something important to ask you.

37:22.390 --> 37:23.620
You must tell me everything you know.

37:23.640 --> 37:24.430
Yes.

37:24.910 --> 37:26.150
Isn't the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

37:26.150 --> 37:27.670
the hero of your people?

37:28.040 --> 37:29.560
He defeated the War Demons.

37:29.870 --> 37:31.670
Why did you still put

37:31.670 --> 37:32.950
the restraining golden hoop on him?

37:41.700 --> 37:43.020
What exactly happened?

37:45.790 --> 37:47.070
Tell me the truth.

37:48.000 --> 37:50.710
That incident happened 60 years ago,

37:50.810 --> 37:52.410
right after the Battle of Pinghu.

37:54.520 --> 37:56.540
[60 years ago]

37:58.790 --> 37:59.670
What is this?

38:00.430 --> 38:01.950
This golden hoop can seal

38:01.950 --> 38:03.070
the Divine Left Hand,

38:03.110 --> 38:04.630
depriving you of the divine power,

38:04.630 --> 38:06.190
and you'll become mortal again.

38:06.740 --> 38:07.550
Yuanzhong,

38:07.950 --> 38:10.110
you are the hero who wiped out the War Demons,

38:10.130 --> 38:11.550
the savior who rescued countless people

38:11.550 --> 38:12.510
from suffering.

38:12.790 --> 38:14.310
You are our High Priest.

38:14.840 --> 38:16.140
We admire and love you.

38:16.140 --> 38:17.190
This won't change

38:17.190 --> 38:18.800
whether you have divine power or not.

38:18.910 --> 38:19.710
Besides,

38:19.940 --> 38:21.740
the Divine Left Hand is a divine artifact

38:21.780 --> 38:23.140
feeding on life force.

38:23.170 --> 38:25.300
You're nurturing it with a mortal body.

38:25.470 --> 38:27.310
You may be able to endure it for a while,

38:27.350 --> 38:28.510
but over time,

38:28.870 --> 38:30.150
it might backfire on you.

38:32.270 --> 38:33.440
I can already control it.

38:33.560 --> 38:35.590
Please rest assured on this, Grand Elder.

38:35.950 --> 38:36.960
You don't understand.

38:37.560 --> 38:38.760
There's another reason.

38:39.140 --> 38:41.360
You were blessed to hold a divine artifact,

38:41.360 --> 38:42.660
saving all living beings from disaster

38:42.660 --> 38:44.000
and accumulating immense merit.

38:44.230 --> 38:45.270
With such a rare encounter,

38:46.180 --> 38:48.510
have you ever thought about transcending mortality

38:48.710 --> 38:50.310
and ascending to deity?

38:50.630 --> 38:51.510
Ascending to deity?

38:52.930 --> 38:53.960
The celestial ladder has been destroyed.

38:54.070 --> 38:55.110
The Gate of Heaven is closed.

38:55.310 --> 38:56.070
In this world,

38:56.070 --> 38:58.070
no one can ascend to heaven and become a god anymore.

38:58.470 --> 38:59.270
Is that so?

39:00.430 --> 39:01.670
But he doesn't know.

39:02.830 --> 39:04.270
He hasn't thought about it.

39:04.270 --> 39:05.350
He really hasn't thought about it.

39:05.350 --> 39:06.390
That's true...

39:06.390 --> 39:07.880
He really didn't.

39:08.590 --> 39:09.390
As expected.

39:09.620 --> 39:11.630
Yes, you didn't think about it.

39:12.150 --> 39:13.030
Even though you were

39:13.030 --> 39:14.740
just one step away from the deity,

39:14.770 --> 39:16.020
you couldn't make it.

39:17.700 --> 39:18.510
Grand Elder,

39:18.710 --> 39:19.670
I don't understand.

39:20.510 --> 39:21.870
You think I could become a god?

39:21.960 --> 39:22.750
Of course.

39:22.990 --> 39:24.940
You are the host of the Divine Left Hand,

39:25.070 --> 39:26.990
possessing power comparable to that of gods.

39:27.030 --> 39:28.830
You've also completely annihilated the War Demons,

39:28.830 --> 39:30.440
achieving numerous accomplishments.

39:30.670 --> 39:31.590
Who in history

39:31.670 --> 39:33.230
could be compared to you?

39:33.350 --> 39:35.110
Why couldn't you become a god?

39:35.630 --> 39:36.750
But I haven't...

39:37.590 --> 39:39.620
It's because you can't get rid of the Five Sins.

39:39.640 --> 39:41.720
You're deeply stuck in worldly desires,

39:41.940 --> 39:43.550
unable to transcend.

39:43.910 --> 39:44.710
The Five Sins?

39:45.110 --> 39:45.910
That's right.

39:47.830 --> 39:48.630
Hypocrisy,

39:48.830 --> 39:49.710
obsession,

39:49.800 --> 39:50.590
ignorance,

39:50.820 --> 39:51.590
jealousy,

39:51.590 --> 39:52.440
and cruelty.

39:52.950 --> 39:53.870
All evil in the world

39:53.870 --> 39:55.270
stems from these.

39:55.350 --> 39:56.990
All people are stuck in these,

39:58.430 --> 39:59.630
and you are no exception.

40:00.310 --> 40:02.510
You've made great achievements at such a young age,

40:02.710 --> 40:04.190
but unfortunately, your mind is too simple.

40:04.190 --> 40:05.910
You haven't experienced the trials of the mortal world,

40:05.910 --> 40:06.870
without a firm resolve.

40:06.870 --> 40:08.070
How can you ascend?

40:08.550 --> 40:10.230
Only by sealing the divine artifact,

40:10.710 --> 40:12.910
comprehending the world with a mortal body,

40:12.910 --> 40:14.100
and solving the Five Sins thoroughly,

40:14.180 --> 40:16.910
will you have the chance to obtain deity.

40:18.020 --> 40:19.030
I don't understand.

40:19.510 --> 40:20.980
He's your High Priest!

40:21.140 --> 40:22.750
Why are you treating him like this?
